  sentences:
  - Squeak!*
  - Hey!
  - Do you know you can interact somethings by pressing "E" on your keyboard.
  - Your goal is to bring me your bag with the highest value you can achieve!
  - But, remember, bringin too much weight will makes you move slower.
  - What are you waiting!
  - Pack your bag and start stealing!
